{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְקָנָה","hw":"אֶלְקָנָה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְקָנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God has created</em>, or <em>taken possession</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  father of Samuel <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1-2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1-2\">1 S 1–2</a> (8 times) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.12\">1 Ch 6:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.19\">19</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  son of Korah <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:24\" href=\"/Exodus.6.24\">Ex 6:24</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  a ruler in Jerusalem in the time of Ahaz <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.7\">2 Ch 28:7</a>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  one of David’s warriors <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.6\">1 Ch 12:6</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  several Levites (α) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.8\">1 Ch 6:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.21\">21</a> (β) v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.20\">20</a> (γ) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.16\">9:16</a> (δ) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.23\">15:23</a>.","next":"BDB, אָלָה","prev":"BDB, אֶלְצָפָן"}